    ["<Assistant_Title1>【第七小组制服】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>主线奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得第七小组制服套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>剧情</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Seventh Group Uniform】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Main Quest Reward Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Seventh Group Uniform set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Plot</>",
    ["<M_Red>「完整填写问卷，将获得300绑定金镑！」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">灰雾测试调研问卷-休闲玩法专题</>\n亲爱的非凡者：\n    愿您的非凡之路平稳顺利。\n    在这个世界的旅途中，您是否曾驻足记录下某个令您心动的剪影？又是否曾于自己的居所中，塑造出一片独属于您的风景？诚邀您通过信件中的隐秘通道，将您的看法与建议分享给我们。\n    您的每一份建议，都将助我们雕琢出更真实的世界。\n    感谢您为这世界带来的改变。祝愿您早日消化魔药，掌控非凡。"] = "<M_Red>「Complete the questionnaire to receive 300 Bound Gold Pounds!」</>\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"web=%s\">Gray Fog Test Survey - Leisure Gameplay Special</>\nDear Beyonder: \n    May your Beyonder path be smooth and steady. \n    During your journey in this world, have you ever stopped to record a silhouette that moved you? Or have you ever shaped a landscape unique to you in your own residence? We sincerely invite you to share your views and suggestions with us through the secret channel in the letter. \n    Every suggestion of yours will help us carve out a more real world. \n    Thank you for the changes you have brought to this world. May you digest your potion and master your Beyonder powers soon.",
