    ["都要接受招生考试的毒打！每一个！\n        我要打造一个干净温馨、整洁明亮，处处是诗歌，家家有花草的首都特里尔。\n        但永恒烈阳教会那群家伙是傻子吗？\n        我保护贸易与推行新法的目的之一，就是为了与他们和解啊！和气生财的道理懂不懂？要追究谋权篡位的事到什么时候，他们果然是被太阳烤坏了脑袋——该死，有点想念故乡的烤脑花了。"] = "everyone must receive the beating of entrance exams! Everyone! \n I want to build a clean, warm, tidy, and bright capital, Trier, where there is poetry everywhere and flowers and plants in every home. \n But are those guys in the Church of the Eternal Blazing Sun idiots? \n One of my purposes for protecting trade and promoting new laws was to reconcile with them! Don't they understand the principle that harmony brings wealth? How long are they going to pursue the matter of usurping the throne? They really have had their brains baked by the sun—damn, I kind of miss the grilled brains from my hometown.",
